{"id":"deaf0e86bfe2a066","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-logical-consequence.md","title":"逻辑后承","display":"df-logical-consequence — 逻辑后承","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-logical-consequence","aliases":["29-df-logical-consequence"],"display":"df-logical-consequence — 逻辑后承","depends_on":["[[29-df-structure]]","[[29-df-struc]]","[[29-df-sentence]]","[[29-df-truth]]"],"source_locator":"Theorems 1.34–1.35 and discussion, pp.21–22, scans 36–37","source_basis":"原书陈述核对及本地语义修订；证明范围见 Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-logical-consequence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-logical-consequence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-logical-consequence — 逻辑后承"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0ac4b9a122d458e2\" href=\"?note=0ac4b9a122d458e2\" title=\"29-df-structure\">29-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4de8e0c8085801f5\" href=\"?note=4de8e0c8085801f5\" title=\"29-df-struc\">29-df-struc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"711217f22972ffc0\" href=\"?note=711217f22972ffc0\" title=\"29-df-sentence\">29-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"754d9a003ca52ced\" href=\"?note=754d9a003ca52ced\" title=\"29-df-truth\">29-df-truth</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Theorems 1.34–1.35 and discussion, pp.21–22, scans 36–37"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"原书陈述核对及本地语义修订；证明范围见 Remark"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-logical-consequence-—-逻辑后承-$\\Phi-\\models-\\varphi$\">df-logical-consequence — 逻辑后承 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi \\models \\varphi\">\\(\\Phi \\models \\varphi\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 为有限词汇，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}[S]\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}[S]\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{STRUC}[S]\">\\(\\mathrm{STRUC}[S]\\)</span> 分别为任意、有限非空模型类。</li>\n<li>闭句真值见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"754d9a003ca52ced\" href=\"?note=754d9a003ca52ced\" title=\"29-df-truth\">29-df-truth</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\\models_S\\varphi\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}[S]\\;((\\forall\\psi\\in\\Phi\\;A\\models\\psi)\\to A\\models\\varphi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Phi\\models_S\\varphi\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}[S]\\;((\\forall\\psi\\in\\Phi\\;A\\models\\psi)\\to A\\models\\varphi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\\models_{S,\\mathrm{fin}}\\varphi\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[S]\\;((\\forall\\psi\\in\\Phi\\;A\\models\\psi)\\to A\\models\\varphi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Phi\\models_{S,\\mathrm{fin}}\\varphi\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[S]\\;((\\forall\\psi\\in\\Phi\\;A\\models\\psi)\\to A\\models\\varphi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\\models\\varphi\\coloneqq\\Phi\\models_S\\varphi.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Phi\\models\\varphi\\coloneqq\\Phi\\models_S\\varphi.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书印刷页 21–22、扫描页 36–37 明确区分任意模型有效性与有限模型有效性。旧文件只给有限后承却供普通完备性使用；现在两种后承各有明确论域。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-logical-consequence-—-逻辑后承-$\\Phi-\\models-\\varphi$","text":"df-logical-consequence — 逻辑后承 $\\Phi \\models \\varphi$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"0ac4b9a122d458e2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-struc","status":"resolved","id":"4de8e0c8085801f5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-struc]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"711217f22972ffc0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-truth","status":"resolved","id":"754d9a003ca52ced","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-truth","status":"resolved","id":"754d9a003ca52ced","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"闭句真值见 [[29-df-truth]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Phi \\models \\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Struct}[S]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{STRUC}[S]","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi\\models_S\\varphi\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}[S]\\;((\\forall\\psi\\in\\Phi\\;A\\models\\psi)\\to A\\models\\varphi).","display":true},{"tex":"\\Phi\\models_{S,\\mathrm{fin}}\\varphi\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[S]\\;((\\forall\\psi\\in\\Phi\\;A\\models\\psi)\\to A\\models\\varphi).","display":true},{"tex":"\\Phi\\models\\varphi\\coloneqq\\Phi\\models_S\\varphi.","display":true}],"bytes":1349,"backlinks":[{"id":"2bbdc67d0a260ff0","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6d4131ca1202619d","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sat}_\\tau$ 与 $\\models_\\tau$ 分别取任意非空结构上的可满足性和后承，见 [[29-df-satisfiable]]、[[29-df-logical-consequence]]；不取有限模型专用版本。"},{"id":"7f92cb4acad3757e","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Gamma\\models_\\tau\\varphi$ 取 [[29-df-logical-consequence]]；$\\operatorname{seqcode}$ 取 [[29-df-godel-numbering]]。$P\\subseteq\\mathbb N^3$ 的三个坐标依次为证明证书、有限前提列表代码、结论代码。"},{"id":"c05483682bbb72c7","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-94","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-logical-consequence]]"}],"outgoing":["0ac4b9a122d458e2","4de8e0c8085801f5","711217f22972ffc0","754d9a003ca52ced"]}